{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t\t*Nix\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"date format strings, command substitution for assignment, and when date echoes instead.","label":"date","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/custom","label":"Custom","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/custom"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/delete","label":"Delete","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/delete"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>date<\/code> prints the current date and time. An optional format string follows <code class='inline'>+<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>date +\"&lt;format string&gt;\"<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Format<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tExample format and output:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>%a %b %e %H:%M:$S %Z %Y\nThu Feb 2 03:28: CET 2012<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Assignment<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tWhen assigning, use command substitution:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>`date [+&lt;format string&gt;]`<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThere is no direct assignment. The value must be echoed. <code class='inline'>date<\/code> echoes when assigned as <code class='inline'>var=&lt;space&gt;date<\/code> (a space after <code class='inline'>=<\/code>), because <code class='inline'>date<\/code> is then run as a command.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/date\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/date\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/custom' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/custom' data-title='Custom' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Custom<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/delete' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/delete' data-title='Delete' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Delete<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/os\/nix.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>*Nix<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}